# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# `text=auto` lets Git detect text files and store them with LF in the repo;
# `eol=lf` checks them out as LF in the working tree too (including on Windows),
# so the round-trip is a no-op and Git stops warning that "LF will be replaced
# by CRLF". Binary files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
